    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Wait! Ch'en, are they about to break the door of that house down?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Has the target already been confirmed? Assemble, quickly!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma",
        "name2": "char_010_chen_1#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "To minimize the loss of civilians, huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Of course! Snipers, take aim!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_015_lmg"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "L.G.D. Agent"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.3
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 0.7,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "text": "...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's Lungmen's army! Fall back!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "text": "We need to contact...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Reunion Member"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Snipers! Shoot down that person with the radio equipment! Stop that transmission!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_136_hsguma"
    },
    {
        "text": "They're supposed to be defending the base, so how come they're running away from us? They're up to something!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Hoshiguma"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_010_chen_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Let's see how far you can run!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Ch'en"
    },
